{"page":411,"width":1730,"height":2593,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"10.8 커널 메모리의할당 471","words":[{"text":"10.8","x":1115,"y":161,"width":69,"height":23},{"text":"커널","x":1201,"y":160,"width":42,"height":26},{"text":"메모리의할당","x":1254,"y":161,"width":147,"height":26},{"text":"471","x":1471,"y":157,"width":53,"height":29}]},{"text":"성된다. 각 커널 자료구조마다 하나의 개시가 존재한다. 예를 들어 프로세스 디스크립","words":[{"text":"성된다.","x":288,"y":285,"width":106,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":415,"y":286,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"커널","x":464,"y":287,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"자료구조마다","x":544,"y":287,"width":184,"height":37},{"text":"하나의","x":743,"y":289,"width":85,"height":36},{"text":"개시가","x":847,"y":289,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"존재한다.","x":952,"y":289,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"예를","x":1099,"y":289,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"들어","x":1175,"y":288,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스","x":1256,"y":288,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"디스크립","x":1403,"y":289,"width":124,"height":37}]},{"text":"터(descriptor)를 위한 개시, 파일 객체를 위한 개시, 세마포어를 위한 개시 등이 존재","words":[{"text":"터(descriptor)를","x":290,"y":344,"width":260,"height":43},{"text":"위한","x":566,"y":346,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"개시,","x":643,"y":347,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"파일","x":724,"y":347,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"객체를","x":799,"y":348,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"위한","x":901,"y":349,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"개시,","x":976,"y":349,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"세마포어를","x":1058,"y":349,"width":156,"height":35},{"text":"위한","x":1230,"y":348,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"개시","x":1309,"y":349,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"등이","x":1386,"y":349,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"존재","x":1466,"y":350,"width":63,"height":36}]},{"text":"한다. 각 개시는 커널 자료구조의 각 인스턴스에 해당하는 객체들로 채워져 있다. 예를","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":288,"y":403,"width":74,"height":36},{"text":"각","x":380,"y":404,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"개시는","x":429,"y":405,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"커널","x":542,"y":406,"width"